        "created_at": "2013-12-24T12:26:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Chrono-Ranger's bounties and equipment are all unique, except for the Temporal Grenade.</p><p>Unity has Champion Bot, Cryo Bot, Stealth Bot, Swift Bot and Turret Bot.</p><p>There's some unique hero cards coming in Vengeance as well, but I can't say what or for whom.</p>",
