      {
        "id": 85164,
        "name": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "username": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/{size}/1967_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-24T13:26:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In addition to the Arcane Cadences, The Argent Adept has 4 Instrumental Conjurations. As mentioned, AZ has four 4s; Chrono-Ranger can match this, with 4 each of Eye one the Prize, Just Doin' My Job, Sudden Contract and Displaced Armory, as well as his aforementioned unique bounties and equipment. Expat has Pride and Prejudice, which are unique. Wrathful Retribution is Fanatic's only 1, and she has no 4s. Fixer has 4 Overdrives and 4 Bloody Knuckleses. As mentioned before, Nightmist has 4 Oblivions. Omnitron-X has 4 Technological Advancements, as well as his 4 Resets. Ra has 4 Summon Staffs to go with his Staffs of Ra. The Scholar has 4 Keep Movings. Unity has 4 Brainstorms, as well as her five unique bots. The Visionary has 4 Mind Spikes. Wraith, Bunker, Legacy, Tachyon, Tempest and Haka have no 1s or 4s.</p><p>Thanks Spiff.</p>",
