        "created_at": "2013-12-24T22:17:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So the Freedom 4 have no 4s...nice.&nbsp; Also, the two \"honorary\" Freedom Team members (as seen in the \"team picnic\" picture on Iron Legacy's one card) follow this pattern, but actual FV member AZ does not.&nbsp; Quite thematic there.</p>",
