        "id": 85166,
        "name": "Benhimself",
        "username": "Benhimself",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/benhimself/{size}/2160_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-24T23:36:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Some of my personal maximum-fist-pump hands, if we were in a sitch where we chose the cards, and then randomly selected the villain/environment:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Legacy: Inspiring Presence, Lead From The Front, Next Evolution, Legacy Ring.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Argent Adept: That song that lets anyone play a card as a perform, that song that lets anyone but you play a card as an accompany, that instrument that lets you do both, and a Silver Shadow (I don't have AA's cards memorized but I know my favorite setup when I see it).</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Scholar: 2xProverbs and Axioms, 2xDon't Dismiss Anything.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Chrono-Ranger: By Any Means, The Ultimate Target, Displaced Armory, Eye On The Prize</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tempest: Grevious Hailstorm, Cleansing Downpour, Gene-Bound Shackles, Into The Stratosphere</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
